    "sections": {
        "description": "Restaurant Eatery Theme is designed for creating a structured website for food and dining-related services. Its layout provides sections for presenting restaurant information, menus, featured dishes, services, and contact details. The homepage can be organized into clear content areas, helping visitors find essential information without unnecessary visual elements. The theme supports responsive layouts, allowing website content to adapt to desktop, tablet, and mobile screen sizes. Navigation menus help organize important pages, while customizable sections can be used to display text, images, and other relevant information. Menu pages can present dishes with descriptions and pricing in an organized format. Restaurant Eatery Theme can also include social media integration, allowing links to external profiles to be displayed on the website. Custom logo and header options help maintain consistent branding across pages. Contact sections can provide business details, location information, operating hours, and inquiry options. Its design structure can be adjusted through available customization settings, making it possible to modify colors, typography, layouts, and other visual elements according to the website’s content and presentation requirements."
    },
